### Listar tareas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks

### Crear tarea
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Mi primera tarea",
    "description": "Nada que mostrar"
}
### Test 1: El Atacante
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Mi primera tarea",
    "description": "Nada que mostrar",
    "id": "soy-un-hacker",
    "completed": true
}
### Test 2: El Cliente Descuidado
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": "Nada que mostrar",
    "id": "soy-un-hacker",
    "completed": true
}
